-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Fagin at the disco.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/58/Fagin_at_the_disco..png/revision/latest?cb=20231117092025\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Fagin at the disco.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/58/Fagin_at_the_disco..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231117092025\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/58/Fagin_at_the_disco..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231117092025 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/58/Fagin_at_the_disco..png/revision/latest?cb=20231117092025 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Fagin at the disco.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Fagin_at_the_disco..png\" data-image-name=\"Fagin at the disco..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_16\" title=\"Series 16\">16</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sue_Perkins\" title=\"Sue Perkins\">Sue Perkins</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Never_packed_a_boot.\" title=\"Never packed a boot.\">Never packed a boot.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Always_forks_and_marbles.\" title=\"Always forks and marbles.\">Always forks and marbles.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Fagin at the disco.</b></i> is the ninth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_16\" title=\"Series 16\">Series 16</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 16 November 2023. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Sue_Perkins\" title=\"Sue Perkins\">Sue Perkins</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Fagin_at_the_disco.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>During the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_Greg_the_best_gift\" title=\"Make Greg the best gift\">Make Greg the best gift</a> task, <a href=\"/wiki/Sam_Campbell\" title=\"Sam Campbell\">Sam Campbell</a> – inspired by the sight of Greg in the coat <a href=\"/wiki/Susan_Wokoma\" title=\"Susan Wokoma\">Susan Wokoma</a> had made for him – describes him as looking like “Fagin at a disco”. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fagin\">Fagin</a> is the leader of the child thieves in the novel <i>Oliver Twist</i>, and is often portrayed in a long, ratty coat. The title card is of a traffic light with the green light on. This is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Drive_across_the_finish_line\" title=\"Drive across the finish line\">Drive across the finish line</a> task.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Fagin_at_the_disco.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Faginin diskokamppeet', which translates as 'Fagin's disco clothes'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Disco'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Fagin på diskoteket', which translates as 'Fagin at the disco'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title. <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Fagin_at_the_disco.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Julian_Clary\" title=\"Julian Clary\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Julian Clary</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lucy_Beaumont\" title=\"Lucy Beaumont\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lucy Beaumont</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sam_Campbell\" title=\"Sam Campbell\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sam Campbell</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sue_Perkins\" title=\"Sue Perkins\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sue Perkins</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Susan_Wokoma\" title=\"Susan Wokoma\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Susan Wokoma</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_bit_of_old_crap_that_Greg_likes_the_best\" title=\"The bit of old crap that Greg likes the best\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The bit of old crap that Greg likes the best.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Drive_across_the_finish_line\" title=\"Drive across the finish line\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Drive across the finish line. You must obey all the rules of the road and must only stop your vehicle at a traffic signal. If you disobey a rule, Alex will blow his whistle and you must return to the start for a 10-second driving lesson.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_Greg_the_best_gift\" title=\"Make Greg the best gift\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make Greg the best gift. Your items must cost no more than £50.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Feed_the_clown_the_most_cards\" title=\"Feed the clown the most cards\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Feed the clown the most cards. No part of you must cross the threshold of the stage.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Alex%27s_parade_then_answer_the_questions\" title=\"Watch Alex&#39;s parade then answer the questions\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Watch Alex's parade then answer the questions. You may not make any notes during the parade.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">20\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Fagin_at_the_disco.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/fagin-disco\"><i>Fagin at the disco.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/\"><i>Fagin at the disco.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141524\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time